.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/d9200f106a1d686aaf205593b55717fc.poster.avif?t=1744194362\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/d9200f106a1d686aaf205593b55717fc.webm?t=1744194362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/d9200f106a1d686aaf205593b55717fc.mp4?t=1744194362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Questionable Crew</h2>Pizza King, Morio and Ultra Chad are only a few of the <strong>weirdos</strong> you'll interact with as you piece together the narrative puzzle and unravel the grand conspiracy happening on Granny's Island! \ud83c\udf34<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/16cb1a65bd4d602b857946e189cc998e.poster.avif?t=1744194362\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/16cb1a65bd4d602b857946e189cc998e.webm?t=1744194362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/16cb1a65bd4d602b857946e189cc998e.mp4?t=1744194362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Genuine Passion Project</h2>This entire project is the brainchild of <strong>Matteo</strong> and <strong>Lorenzo</strong>, who made everything from scratch out of genuine passion for the olden days of video games! \ud83c\udfae The game wholly reflects their personality, and judging by the trailer... trust us, it's a trip worth taking!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2011780/extras/d4426d5686eabae27ffc4e885edf1a90.poster.avif?t=1744194362\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i